{
  name: "ore-gens"
  displayName: "Ore Generators"
  author: "MohamedGonem"
  version: "1.1.0"
  minGameVersion: "159"
  repo: "MohamedGonem/ore-gens"
  description:
    '''
    Blocks that extract and synthesize ore from airborne trace elements,
    dissolved ion suspensions and cryogenic precipitation.

    Four tiers per ore:
    - Small Powered (2x2): fast, needs power, moderate cost.
    - Small Unpowered (2x2): slow, no power, expensive to build.
    - Liquid-fed (3x3): fast, needs water (ozone on Erekir), no power.
    - Cryofluid-fed (3x3): fastest, needs power + cryofluid.

    Ores: copper, lead, coal, titanium, scrap, thorium, sand (Serpulo),
    beryllium, tungsten (Erekir).

    Every tier is gated behind a 3-step research quest (12 milestones per ore)
    with escalating, ore-specific costs. Upgrades are gated by research too:
    Speed I-III, Capacity I-III, Output I-II, Efficiency I-II.
    Animated: powered, liquid and cryo tiers glow and spin while running.
    '''
}